{"title":"Creative Code Toronto work session","startsAt":"2026-10-14T17:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-14T20:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"Join us for a Toronto meetup of creative coders! Instead of our usual show-and-tell, this will be a **work session!** If you're looking for some motivation to tinker on a creative project, now's your chance!\n\n**What is creative code?** *Creative coding* refers to anything with an artistic component that uses code as a medium. We welcome artists who use code (for visuals, audio, poetry, or whatever else), designers, animators, toolmakers, researchers, or just enjoyers and people looking to learn more!\n\n**Location:** Impact Kitchen on Queens Quay (88 Queens Quay W, Toronto, ON M5J 0B6)\n\n**Join our discord** if you want to talk to everyone before/after the event, or have any suggestions for things you'd like to see or do! [https://discord.gg/ux9txXPsdJ](https://discord.gg/ux9txXPsdJ)","venue":{"name":"88 Queens Quay W","address":"88 Queens Quay W, Toronto","lat":43.641083,"lng":-79.37872,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Creative Code Toronto","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/4/c/7/6/highres_513319574.jpeg"}